// purpose: KQL Regex List · Subnet
// source: https://github.com/Bert-JanP/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/65d11700e1cb878403d87312acdd6b9a8dd622c1/KQL%20Regex/RegexExamples.md
